{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/guidance/help-with-charitable-giving-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return","content_id":"e61da410-e11f-4f9d-bfc7-4bf7ae826875","description":"Find information on completing the charitable giving section of your Self Assessment tax return.","details":{"attachments":[],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>Individuals may be able to claim tax relief on donations made to charity or to community amateur sports clubs (<abbr title=\"community amateur sports clubs\">CASCs</abbr>). Find out more about <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/donating-to-charity\">tax relief when you donate to a charity</a>.</p>\n\n<p>Before filling in your tax return, you can <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/calculate-the-value-of-your-donation-to-charity\">work out how much tax relief you can claim</a> if you donate or sell land, property or shares to a charity.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"helpsheets-for-filling-in-your-tax-return\">Helpsheets for filling in your tax return</h2>\n\n<p>Helpsheets provide information which can help you complete your Self Assessment tax return.</p>\n\n<p>Use <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/charitable-giving-hs342-self-assessment-helpsheet\">Charitable giving tax relief (HS342)</a> if you donate to charity through:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Gift Aid</li>\n  <li>Payroll Giving</li>\n  <li>gifts of shares and securities</li>\n  <li>gifts of land or buildings</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 id=\"hmrc-youtube-video\">HMRC YouTube video</h2>\n\n<p>Watch a video of a recorded webinar about other income and tax reliefs on your online tax return.</p>\n\n<p><a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RD_mCehH6Ek\">Other income and tax reliefs on your online tax return</a></p>\n\n<p>You will learn about:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>other income, such as work pensions</li>\n  <li>tax reliefs, including payments to charity</li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"The section on registering for webinars has been removed.","public_timestam